 8. 🦐 1 fun thing: Where both parties party 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 The Bidens leave Drago's Seafood Restaurant in New Orleans after dinner in August 2024. Photo: Brendan Smialowski/AFP via Getty Images From hosting then-President Biden to catering election-night gatherings for House Majority Leader Steve Scalise (R-La.), Drago's Seafood Restaurant in New Orleans has found a bivalve secret to bipartisan appeal, Axios New Orleans' Chelsea Brasted writes. 

